{"id":"496002","name":"水晶蜜枣莲藕圆","author":"花鱼儿","authorId":"404188","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/496002/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"糯米粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"莲藕粉","amount":"2包"},{"name":"水晶蜜枣","amount":"1包"}],"sub":[{"name":"冰糖","amount":"3小块"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"食材：糯米粉","img":"images/496002/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"莲藕粉","img":"images/496002/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"水晶蜜枣","img":"images/496002/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"冰糖","img":"images/496002/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"将莲藕粉拆开包装倒入大碗中。","img":"images/496002/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加适量的热水调匀。","img":"images/496002/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"将糯米粉合入调匀的莲藕粉中。","img":"images/496002/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"和成莲藕团。","img":"images/496002/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"随后，取一点莲藕团搓成一个个小圆子，待用。","img":"images/496002/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"接着，将冰糖搁入清水锅中。","img":"images/496002/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"煮开，至冰糖融化。","img":"images/496002/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"然后，下入莲藕圆煮开。","img":"images/496002/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"煮至莲藕圆浮起。","img":"images/496002/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"最后，将水晶蜜枣拆开包装合入莲藕圆中略煮，即可。","img":"images/496002/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：汤锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}